---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Mike Mello" description="About Mike Mello — stand-up comedian, credits, and bio.">
	<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
		<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-warm-ivory">About</h1>

		<!-- Bio -->
		<section class="mb-16 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-spotlight-gold">Bio</h2>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
				<div class="md:col-span-2">
					<img
						src="/images/incognegro-live-stage.jpg"
						alt="Mike Mello performing live during Incognegro"
						width="1086"
						height="923"
						loading="lazy"
						class="rounded-lg border border-warm-ivory/10 w-full h-full object-cover"
					/>
				</div>
				<div class="md:col-span-3 bg-dim-house border border-warm-ivory/10 p-8 rounded-lg">
					<p class="text-warm-ivory mb-4">
						A self-described "black hippie" (<em>INDY Week</em>) and 20+ year veteran of the comedy circuit, Mike Mello has been making rooms laugh since his start at Raleigh's legendary Charlie Goodnight's Comedy Club.
					</p>
					<p class="text-warm-ivory">
						Virginia-born and based in Raleigh after nearly 25 years in Cary, Mike has shared stages with some of the biggest names in stand-up — touring with Tracy Morgan (who once tried to buy a joke from him) and Russell Peters, and opening for Dave Chappelle, Ralphie May, Damon Wayans, and D.L. Hughley. He was a finalist in the NBC Stand-Up Diversity Showcase, can be heard on SiriusXM, and starred in his own hour-long special, <em>Incognegro</em> (2018), followed by <em>What's Seasoning?</em> on HITKOR. In 2022, he appeared on <em>D.L. Hughley's Speakeasy: Comedy Overload</em>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Credits -->
		<section class="mb-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-spotlight-gold">Credits</h2>
			<div class="bg-dim-house border border-warm-ivory/10 p-8 rounded-lg">
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-lg text-warm-ivory">
					<li><strong><em>Incognegro</em></strong> (2018) — hour-long stand-up special</li>
					<li><strong><em>What's Seasoning?</em></strong> — second special, streaming on HITKOR</li>
					<li><strong><em>D.L. Hughley's Speakeasy: Comedy Overload</em></strong> (2022)</li>
					<li>NBC Stand-Up Diversity Showcase — finalist</li>
					<li>SiriusXM Radio</li>
					<li>Toured with Tracy Morgan and Russell Peters</li>
					<li>Opened for Dave Chappelle, Ralphie May, D.L. Hughley, and Damon Wayans</li>
					<li>Headlined Charlie Goodnight's, The Idiot Box, SECCA, and Segra Stadium</li>
					<li>IMDB profile: <a href="https://www.imdb.com/name/nm9610033/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-spotlight-gold hover:text-stage-amber">imdb.com/name/nm9610033</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Quotes / Press blurb -->
		<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-spotlight-gold">What People Are Saying</h2>
			<div class="bg-warm-dark p-8 rounded-lg">
				<blockquote class="text-xl italic text-warm-ivory mb-2">
					"One of the most respected comedians in the community."
				</blockquote>
				<p class="text-sm text-smoke">— INDY Week</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
